adamic: /workspace/adamic/internal/oracle/testdata/checked-runtime-fields_refused/set.a:5:76: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type Result[] seen as { done?: boolean | undefined; value: string | undefined; }[], whose readonly field done becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than boolean | undefined, which a write of boolean | undefined would replace; keep done readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable)
